        "gold_reasoning": "Lorraine starts with 60 small stickers and trades 80% of them for large buttons. This means she trades 60 * 0.8 =  48 small stickers for large buttons.\nShe also starts with 80 large stickers and trades 60% of them for large buttons. This means she trades 80 * 0.6 = 48 large stickers for large buttons.\n\nThe rest of her large stickers are traded for small buttons. This means she trades 80 - 48 =  32 large stickers for small buttons.\n\nSince each large sticker is worth three small buttons, she gets 32 * 3 =  96 small buttons.\n\nSo in total, Lorraine has 48 large buttons + 48 large buttons + 96 small buttons =  192 buttons.\n#### 192"
      }
